   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Ban Treaty On-Site Inspection Integrated Field Exercise</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Ce projet apporte une contribution financi&#xe8;re &#xe0; la Commission pr&#xe9;paratoire de l&#x2019;Organisation du Trait&#xe9; d&#x2019;interdiction compl&#xe8;te des essais nucl&#xe9;aires pour soutenir le prochain exercice int&#xe9;gr&#xe9; sur le terrain portant sur les inspections sur place.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides a financial contribution to the Preparatory Commission of the Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Ban Treaty Organization to support the next Integrated Field Exercise for on-site inspection.</narrative>
  </description>
